## detect-constraint-failure.soar -- thor-soar: 1 elaboration.

## Elaborate evaluate-operator state detect-constraint-failure metal microwave -> sets constraint-failure, failure-string.
## Metal in microwave failure
sp {evaluate-operator*elaborate*state*detect-constraint-failure*metal*microwave
   :default
   (state <s> ^real false
              ^desireds <desireds>
              ^world <world>)
   (<world> ^objects.object <object>
            ^in <in>)
   (<object> ^class microwave
             ^activated true)
   (<in> ^argument1.material metal
         ^argument2.class microwave)
-->
   (log 1 (crlf) | ** Constraint Failure ** metal in microwave and microwave on **|)
   (<s> ^constraint-failure <desireds>
        ^failure-string | ** Constraint Failure ** metal in microwave and microwave on **|)}

